<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Green frogs, pink hogs</l><l>Came into being, came into being;</l><l>Big blue whales, slimy snails</l><l>Came into being thru Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Skies of blue, morning dew</l><l>Came into being, came into being;</l><l>Streams that flow, falling snow</l><l>Came into being thru Him.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
